{"type":"after","callId":"call@168","endTime":6193.465,"result":{"value":"Dashboard section\nE\nE2E Test Site\nLIVE\n1\nE\n\nWORKSPACE\n\nDashboard\nEditor\nSnapshots\nAnalytics\n\nCAPABILITIES\n\nForms\nApps\nFeatures\nSocial\nVoice\n\nOPERATIONS\n\nLogs\n\nACCOUNT\n\nDocs\nSettings\nMore tools\ne2e-test-site.projectsites.dev\nDashboard\nQuick find\n⌘K\nFull width\nActions\n1\n?\n/\nSITES\n/\n\nSite status\n\nLIVE · FROM YOUR ACCOUNT, AUTO-REFRESHED EVERY 30S\n\n1\nLive\npublished + serving\nBuild your site\nEditor\nEdit your site’s code and content in the live Bolt editor.\nBOLT\nCODE\nCONTENT\nBUILD\n→\nSnapshots\nFrozen versions of every build — preview, restore, or roll back.\nVERSIONS\nRESTORE\nROLLBACK\nHISTORY\n→\nMedia\nUpload, generate, and organize images, video, and audio.\nIMAGES\nVIDEO\nAUDIO\nASSETS\nUPLOAD\n→\nDomains\nConnect a custom domain and manage your hostnames.\nDNS\nHOSTNAME\nCUSTOM\nSSL\n→\nGrow your audience\nAnalytics\nTraffic, conversions, and funnel insight for every site.\nTRAFFIC\nCONVERSIONS\nFUNNEL\nMETRICS\n→\nSEO\nTitles, meta, structured data, and search readiness.\nMETA\nSCHEMA\nKEYWORDS\nRANKING\n→\nSocial\nCompose, schedule, and measure posts across 11 networks.\nPOSTS\nSCHEDULE\nTWITTER\nLINKEDIN\n→\nForms\nEvery form submission, routed and searchable.\nSUBMISSIONS\nLEADS\nCONTACT\n→\nOperate & monitor\nVoice\nA phone number, SMS, and a browser test console.\nPHONE\nSMS\nCALL\nNUMBER\n→\nApps\nA self-hostable app store on Cloudflare Containers.\nMARKETPLACE\nINSTALL\nCONTAINERS\nSELF-HOST\n→\nTraces\nEvery AI call — forms, chat, endpoints, and search.\nAI\nLLM\nOBSERVABILITY\nCALLS\n→\nLogs\nAudit trail plus structured request, AI, and job logs.\nAUDIT\nREQUESTS\nJOBS\nDEBUG\n→\nAccount & help\nSettings\nSite preferences, integrations, and notifications.\nPREFERENCES\nINTEGRATIONS\nMCP\nWEBHOOKS\n→\nBilling\nYour plan, credits, and invoices in one place.\nPLAN\nCREDITS\nINVOICES\nSUBSCRIPTION\n→\nAPI Docs\nAn interactive explorer — call any endpoint from your session.\nOPENAPI\nREFERENCE\nENDPOINTS\n→\nFeatures\nTurn site capabilities on — plan-aware and reversible.\nCAPABILITIES\nADDONS\nPLAN\nAUTOPILOT\n→\nTips & tricks\nPress ⌘K (or Ctrl+K) to jump to any section or action instantly.\nPress / to focus this search and filter every section as you type.\nHover a card and tap the ☆ to pin your most-used sections to the top.\nDrag a file onto any admin page to add it to your Media library.\nNeed a hand?\nRead the API docs\nAccount & preferences\nContact support\n\n0 site in your account\n\nAsk AI"},"afterSnapshot":"after@call@168"}
