{"type":"after","callId":"call@355","endTime":10188.59,"result":{"value":"Features section\nE\nE2E Test Site\nLIVE\n1\nE\n\nWORKSPACE\n\nDashboard\nEditor\nSnapshots\nAnalytics\n\nCAPABILITIES\n\nForms\nApps\nFeatures\nSocial\nVoice\n\nOPERATIONS\n\nLogs\n\nACCOUNT\n\nDocs\nSettings\nMore tools\ne2e-test-site.projectsites.dev\nFeatures\nQuick find\n⌘K\nFull width\nActions\n1\n?\n\nCONTROL PLANE · LAYER 2\n\nFeatures\n\nTurn capabilities on for E2E Test Site. 0 enabled · 0 available on your free plan. Platform operators manage system flags under Feature Flags →.\n\nShowing 14 features\nLive feature management is provisioning for this site. The catalog below is read-only for now — toggles activate once setup completes. Retry\nDonations\nSELL\nOFF\nINCLUDED\n\nAdd a donate page to your site; payments are processed securely through Stripe via the site form handler.\n\nOne-tap donate page with suggested amounts\nStripe-secured cards + Apple Pay / Google Pay\nOne-time and recurring gifts\nAutomatic emailed receipts\n\nOff — flip the switch to turn it on. You can undo anytime.\n\nSpec ↗\nPreview\nNewsletter\nGROW\nOFF\nPRO+\n\nCollect subscribers and send branded email campaigns from your own domain.\n\nBranded signup form embedded on your site\nCampaign composer — send from your own domain\nSubscriber list with consent tracking\nOpen + click reporting\n\nLocked — included on the pro plan and above.\n\nSpec ↗\n\nIncluded on the pro plan and above.\n\nUpgrade plan →\nAI SEO Autopilot\nGROW\nOFF\nPRO+\n\nAI writes titles, meta, and answer blocks per page and keeps stale sections fresh — you approve before it applies.\n\nAI-written titles + meta descriptions per page\nAI-search \"quotable answer\" blocks\nStale-section refresh suggestions\nYou approve every change before it ships\n\nLocked — included on the pro plan and above.\n\nSpec ↗\n\nIncluded on the pro plan and above.\n\nUpgrade plan →\nGoogle Business Profile\nGROW\nOFF\nPRO+\n\nOne-click setup + AI-optimized content for your Google Business Profile so you show up in local search and Maps.\n\nGuided Google Business Profile setup\nAI-optimized description + posts\nLocal-search + Maps visibility\nDrafted replies to customer reviews\n\nLocked — included on the pro plan and above.\n\nSpec ↗\n\nIncluded on the pro plan and above.\n\nUpgrade plan →\nInstant Indexing\nGROW\nOFF\nINCLUDED\n\nAuto-submit new and updated pages to Google and Bing the moment you publish.\n\nAuto-ping Google + Bing the moment you publish\nNew and updated URLs submitted automatically\nIndex-status tracking per page\nNo manual Search Console steps\n\nOff — flip the switch to turn it on. You can undo anytime.\n\nSpec ↗\nPreview\nLocal SEO Pages\nGROW\nOFF\nBUSINESS+\n\nAuto-generate location and service landing pages from real data to rank for \"near me\" searches.\n\nAuto-built location landing pages\nService × city page matrix\nContent generated from real data\nTargets \"near me\" / local intent queries\n\nLocked — included on the business plan and above.\n\nSpec ↗\n\nIncluded on the business plan and above.\n\nUpgrade plan →\nVisitor Inbox\nENGAGE\nOFF\nPRO+\n\nEvery form, chat, and message from your site in one inbox, with AI-drafted replies.\n\nForms, chat + messages in one inbox\nAI-drafted replies you can edit + send\nAssign, snooze + mark resolved\nFull per-site conversation history\n\nLocked — included on the pro plan and above.\n\nSpec ↗\n\nIncluded on the pro plan and above.\n\nUpgrade plan →\nAI Assistant Access\nGROW\nOFF\nBUSINESS+\n\nMake your site queryable by Siri, Claude, and ChatGPT via a per-site MCP server.\n\nPer-site MCP endpoint\nQueryable by Claude, ChatGPT + Siri\nRead-only by default\nToken-gated access you control\n\nLocked — included on the business plan and above.\n\nSpec ↗\n\nIncluded on the business plan and above.\n\nUpgrade plan →\nOnline Store\nSELL\nOFF\nBUSINESS+\n\nSell products from your site — catalog, cart, and secure checkout, with inventory tracking.\n\nProduct catalog with images + variants\nCart and secure card checkout\nInventory + order tracking\nWorks alongside AI Checkout for in-chat buying\n\nLocked — included on the business plan and above.\n\nSpec ↗\n\nIncluded on the business plan and above.\n\nUpgrade plan →\nAI Checkout\nSELL\nOFF\nBUSINESS+\n\nLet shoppers buy from your store right inside ChatGPT and Gemini via the Agentic Commerce + Universal Commerce protocols.\n\nBuyable inside ChatGPT (Agentic Commerce Protocol)\nBuyable inside Gemini (Universal Commerce Protocol)\nScoped, single-use payment tokens — card never exposed\nReuses your existing store + payment setup\n\nLocked — included on the business plan and above.\n\nSpec ↗\n\nIncluded on the business plan and above.\n\nUpgrade plan →\nAI Concierge\nENGAGE\nOFF\nPRO+\n\nA visitor-facing chat that answers questions using your own content — hours, pricing, services — grounded, never made up.\n\nVisitor chat grounded in your own content\nAnswers hours, pricing, services — never invented\nReranked retrieval for accurate replies\nHand-off to your inbox when it can’t answer\n\nLocked — included on the pro plan and above.\n\nSpec ↗\n\nIncluded on the pro plan and above.\n\nUpgrade plan →\nPage Audio\nENGAGE\nOFF\nPRO+\n\nAuto-generate a short narrated audio version of each page — better dwell time and an accessible, audio-first experience.\n\nShort narrated audio version of each page\nGenerated automatically on publish\nAccessible, audio-first experience\nImproves dwell time + time-on-page\n\nLocked — included on the pro plan and above.\n\nSpec ↗\n\nIncluded on the pro plan and above.\n\nUpgrade plan →\nAccessibility Autopilot\nGROW\nOFF\nPRO+\n\nContinuous accessibility scans with one-click fixes and an ADA-ready compliance report for your site.\n\nContinuous automated accessibility scans\nOne-click fix suggestions\nADA Title II-ready compliance report\nPer-page issue tracking over time\n\nLocked — included on the pro plan and above.\n\nSpec ↗\n\nIncluded on the pro plan and above.\n\nUpgrade plan →\nLanguages\nGROW\nOFF\nPRO+\n\nMirror your site into more languages with AI translation, correct hreflang tags, and right-to-left support.\n\nAI translation into your chosen languages\nCorrect hreflang + canonical per locale\nRight-to-left layout support\nLanguage switcher on your live site\n\nLocked — included on the pro plan and above.\n\nSpec ↗\n\nIncluded on the pro plan and above.\n\nUpgrade plan →\nApps\nAsk AI"},"afterSnapshot":"after@call@355"}
