{"type":"after","callId":"call@402","endTime":11505.968,"result":{"value":"Voice section\nE\nE2E Test Site\nLIVE\n1\nE\n\nWORKSPACE\n\nDashboard\nEditor\nSnapshots\nAnalytics\n\nCAPABILITIES\n\nForms\nApps\nFeatures\nSocial\nVoice\n\nOPERATIONS\n\nLogs\n\nACCOUNT\n\nDocs\nSettings\nMore tools\ne2e-test-site.projectsites.dev\nVoice\nQuick find\n⌘K\nFull width\nActions\n1\n?\nPHONE · SMS · BROWSER\nVoice\nLIVE FOR\nE2E TEST SITE\n\nSame AI persona that powers your web chat answers every call and text. Pick a vanity number, listen to recordings, tune the system prompt — without ever rewriting your agent.\n\n1\ncontrol surfaces — numbers, calls, agent, MCPs & more, one persona\nNumbers\nBuy + manage\nConversations\nCalls + SMS feed\nTest Console\nCall from browser\nAgent\nPrompts + voice\nMCPs\nTool access\nShare\nHand it out\nPHONE NUMBERS\nYour numbers\n0\n/\n0\n\nUp to 3 numbers per site. Release one to free a slot.\n\nMonthly spend\n$0.00\nNo numbers yet\n\nPick a vanity word below — your AI agent picks up the moment a caller dials.\n\nFIND A NUMBER\nVanity + area-code search\n\nType letters or digits. \"LABOR\" matches \"52267\", \"MOVE\" matches \"6683\".\n\nSearch query\nArea code\nAI\nSuggested vanity words\n\nRanked by memorability + relevance to your business.\n\nRegenerate\n\nNo suggestions yet — click Regenerate.\n\nSocial\nAsk AI"},"afterSnapshot":"after@call@402"}
